WEBVTT

00:06:26.757 --> 00:06:31.387
They know that being on the land
is where they are the best human beings

00:06:31.429 --> 00:06:32.763
that they can be.

00:06:33.681 --> 00:06:36.851
Researchers have documented
the impacts of guardian programs.

00:06:37.226 --> 00:06:41.355
They can reduce incarceration
and increase health and well-being.

00:06:41.689 --> 00:06:46.110
People's health improves on the land
because they're on the land,

00:06:46.152 --> 00:06:48.112
because they're physically active

00:06:48.154 --> 00:06:50.322
and because they're happy.

00:06:51.115 --> 00:06:53.492
And guardians gained increased skills,

00:06:53.534 --> 00:06:57.163
higher incomes and pride
in cultural knowledge.

00:06:57.872 --> 00:07:02.543
In fact, one study in 2016 documented
the impacts of those guardian programs